# game/ch13.rpy:12
translate english ch13_f342a36c:

    # n "周日晚上，阿狐在平板上玩小游戏，玩得正起劲，屏幕突然弹出一个大转盘页面。"
    n "Sunday evening. Ahu was deep into a little game on his tablet when a prize-wheel page suddenly popped up."

# game/ch13.rpy:13
translate english ch13_dd2a174c:

    # n "「恭喜您成为本平台第88888位用户，被抽中为幸运大奖得主：最新款手机一部＋888元现金红包！」"
    n "\"Congratulations! As this platform's 88,888th user, you've been drawn as the lucky grand-prize winner: the newest phone + an 888-yuan cash red packet!\""

# game/ch13.rpy:14
translate english ch13_3499d46c:

    # mc laugh "88888位用户就是我？我是天选之子吗！"
    mc laugh "Out of 88,888 users, it's me? Am I the chosen one!"

# game/ch13.rpy:15
translate english ch13_ce47154e:

    # n "页面下方写着：点击领取，验证身份后24小时内发放。"
    n "Below, the page said: tap to claim — verified identities receive the prize within 24 hours."

# game/ch13.rpy:16
translate english ch13_0695ac44:

    # think laugh "手机加888元，这运气没谁了！"
    think laugh "A phone plus 888 yuan! Nobody has luck like mine!"

# game/ch13.rpy:19
translate english ch13_cf2d91c3:

    # n "点击领取后，页面跳转到「领奖登记中心」，同时一个「兑奖客服」发来了消息。"
    n "He tapped claim, the page jumped to a \"Prize Registration Center\", and a \"prize support\" agent messaged him."

# game/ch13.rpy:20
translate english ch13_fdd452c7:

    # fraud laugh "恭喜幸运用户！请登记姓名、身份证号、手机号，并支付88元「公证费」激活大奖，24小时内发放！"
    fraud laugh "Congratulations, lucky user! Register your name, ID number, and phone number, then pay an 88-yuan \"notary fee\" to activate the grand prize — delivered within 24 hours!"

# game/ch13.rpy:34
translate english ch13_A_815bdc53:

    # n "「公证费」三个字让阿狐的手停在了半空。"
    n "The words \"notary fee\" stopped Ahu's hand in mid-air."

# game/ch13.rpy:35
translate english ch13_A_47c590c3:

    # think serious "老师说，凡是中奖后还要先交钱的，全是诈骗！什么幸运用户，就是冲着填信息来的！"
    think serious "Teacher said: any prize that charges you first is fraud! And this \"lucky user\" business is just after my information!"

# game/ch13.rpy:36
translate english ch13_A_1cd84a2f:

    # mc serious "玩个游戏突然「中大奖」，还要交钱登记——不用想，假的！"
    mc serious "A random game suddenly \"wins big\" and wants money to register — no need to think. It's fake!"

# game/ch13.rpy:37
translate english ch13_A_6312cec3:

    # n "阿狐关闭页面、举报了弹窗广告，并提醒一起玩游戏的表弟别点。"
    n "Ahu closed the page, reported the pop-up ad, and warned his cousin who played the same game not to tap it."

# game/ch13.rpy:38
translate english ch13_A_a355eaab:

    # n "后来表弟说，他同学点了同款弹窗，交了88元「公证费」就被拉黑了。"
    n "Later his cousin said a classmate tapped the same pop-up, paid the 88-yuan \"notary fee\", and got blocked."

# game/ch13.rpy:41
translate english ch13_A_7846dcaf:

    # police laugh "反应满分！游戏里的「幸运弹窗」是钓鱼广告，专门收集个人信息、骗取「手续费」。记住：没参加过的抽奖，永远不可能中奖！"
    police laugh "Full marks for reflexes! \"Lucky pop-ups\" in games are phishing ads after personal info and \"handling fees\". Remember: a draw you never entered can never be won!"

# game/ch13.rpy:53
translate english ch13_B_923e2ace:

    # mc confused "是我中奖，为什么领奖还要我先交88元公证费呀？"
    mc confused "I won the prize — why do I pay an 88-yuan notary fee to claim it?"

# game/ch13.rpy:54
translate english ch13_B_9b7032a6:

    # fraud laugh "这是《奖品发放管理条例》规定的！你看，这是官方「中奖名单」，你是第7位；这是今天别人缴公证费的记录，大奖都发出去啦！"
    fraud laugh "It's in the Prize Distribution Regulations! Look — here's the official \"winner list\", you're No.7; here are today's notary fee records. Prizes are going out!"

# game/ch13.rpy:55
translate english ch13_B_a4cff4b6:

    # n "对方发来一张「中奖名单」截图和一排「缴费凭证」，看着像模像样。"
    n "The scammer sent a \"winner list\" screenshot and a row of \"payment receipts\" — quite convincing."

# game/ch13.rpy:56
translate english ch13_B_3319e474:

    # fraud serious "大奖只保留24小时，逾期自动作废并顺延给下一位幸运用户！"
    fraud serious "The prize is held for 24 hours only — after that it's voided and rolls to the next lucky user!"

# game/ch13.rpy:70
translate english ch13_B1_2326ab47:

    # n "阿狐关掉对话，拿着平板走进客厅。"
    n "Ahu closed the chat and carried the tablet into the living room."

# game/ch13.rpy:71
translate english ch13_B1_2ca2b648:

    # think worried "名单和缴费记录看着挺真的……可「先交钱」这一点，还是不对劲。问问妈妈吧。"
    think worried "The list and receipts look pretty real... but the \"pay first\" part still feels off. Ask Mom."

# game/ch13.rpy:72
translate english ch13_B1_ca4966ab:

    # mc worried "妈妈，玩小游戏弹窗说我中了手机，让我交88元公证费，你看这中奖名单是真的吗？"
    mc worried "Mom, a game pop-up says I won a phone and wants an 88-yuan notary fee. Is this winner list real?"

# game/ch13.rpy:73
translate english ch13_B1_b7788db4:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是「虚假中奖」骗局！名单和缴费凭证都能批量伪造。真抽奖你根本没参加过，怎么会中奖？领奖交钱的，全是骗子。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is the \"fake prize\" scam! Lists and receipts can be mass-forged. You never even entered a draw — how could you win? Any prize that charges is a scammer."

# game/ch13.rpy:74
translate english ch13_B1_a3daf5c6:

    # n "妈妈陪阿狐举报了弹窗和账号。"
    n "Mom helped Ahu report the pop-up and the account."

# game/ch13.rpy:77
translate english ch13_B1_1a5f5f3a:

    # police laugh "带着证据问家长，做得漂亮！记住：所有「中奖名单」「兑奖凭证」都可以PS，唯一做不了假的，是「没参加过的抽奖不会中奖」！"
    police laugh "Bringing evidence to your parents — beautiful! Remember: every \"winner list\" and \"receipt\" can be photoshopped. The one thing that can't be faked: a draw you never entered can't be won!"

# game/ch13.rpy:89
translate english ch13_B2_75786afd:

    # mc serious "名单我不看，公证费我不交，身份证号更不能给。要么原路发放奖品，不然就当我没中。"
    mc serious "I won't look at the list, won't pay the fee, and certainly won't give my ID number. Deliver the prize through the original channel, or I'll count it as never won."

# game/ch13.rpy:90
translate english ch13_B2_490eb08f:

    # fraud serious "不登记不缴费，就是自动弃奖！机会难得，再想想！"
    fraud serious "No registration, no payment — that's automatic forfeiture! A rare chance. Think again!"

# game/ch13.rpy:91
translate english ch13_B2_41b33d42:

    # think serious "催得越急，越像骗子。弃奖就弃奖！"
    think serious "The harder they rush me, the more they look like scammers. Forfeit it, then!"

# game/ch13.rpy:92
translate english ch13_B2_3939f994:

    # n "阿狐关闭页面并举报。24小时后，「兑奖客服」果然注销了账号——哪有什么下一位幸运用户。"
    n "Ahu closed the page and reported it. Twenty-four hours later, the \"prize support\" account was indeed deleted — so much for the \"next lucky user\"."

# game/ch13.rpy:95
translate english ch13_B2_a06a350f:

    # police serious "不为「大奖」动摇，守住了信息和钱包！「弃奖恐吓」是骗子的最后通牒，识破了它，骗局就演不下去了。"
    police serious "Unmoved by the \"grand prize\", you protected both your information and your wallet! \"Forfeiture threats\" are the scammer's last ultimatum — see through it and the show can't go on."

# game/ch13.rpy:107
translate english ch13_B3_dafb68bc:

    # n "阿狐在「登记中心」填了姓名、身份证号和手机号。"
    n "Ahu filled in his name, ID number, and phone number at the \"registration center\"."

# game/ch13.rpy:108
translate english ch13_B3_629c7e58:

    # n "刚提交，页面显示：身份验证通过，请支付88元公证费激活大奖。"
    n "Right after submitting, the page showed: identity verified — pay the 88-yuan notary fee to activate the grand prize."

# game/ch13.rpy:109
translate english ch13_B3_00843d2a:

    # n "付款页面弹出的一瞬间，阿狐突然想起老师的反诈口诀：中奖先交钱，必是骗局！"
    n "The instant the payment page popped up, Ahu remembered the teacher's rhyme: a prize that charges first is always a scam!"

# game/ch13.rpy:110
translate english ch13_B3_7ce6623a:

    # think serious "等等！名单能造假，缴费记录也能造假，我不能交钱！"
    think serious "Wait! Lists can be faked, receipts can be faked — I'm not paying!"

# game/ch13.rpy:111
translate english ch13_B3_cfa0df06:

    # mc serious "我不交了，你们是骗子！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying. You're scammers!"

# game/ch13.rpy:112
translate english ch13_B3_df81230a:

    # n "阿狐退出页面，把经过告诉妈妈。妈妈修改了关联账户密码，并叮嘱身份证号泄露要格外警惕冒名办卡。"
    n "Ahu left the page and told Mom. She changed the linked account passwords and warned him to watch for cards opened in his name after the ID leak."

# game/ch13.rpy:115
translate english ch13_B3_a7b7e1ea:

    # police serious "好险！姓名、身份证号、手机号已经打包泄露给骗子，后续可能收到各种「精准诈骗」。没交钱算万幸，信息防线一定要筑牢！"
    police serious "Close call! Name, ID number, and phone number went straight to the scammers — targeted scams may follow. Not paying was sheer luck; build that information defense wall high!"

# game/ch13.rpy:127
translate english ch13_C_60f25753:

    # n "阿狐把身份信息登记好，支付了88元「公证费」，坐等大奖。"
    n "Ahu registered his information, paid the 88-yuan \"notary fee\", and waited for the grand prize."

# game/ch13.rpy:128
translate english ch13_C_14986315:

    # think laugh "手机马上到手，还有888元红包！"
    think laugh "The phone is nearly mine — plus an 888-yuan red packet!"

# game/ch13.rpy:129
translate english ch13_C_1a51e057:

    # fraud laugh "公证费已收到！系统正在为你准备奖品……"
    fraud laugh "Notary fee received! The system is preparing your prize..."

# game/ch13.rpy:130
translate english ch13_C_33dc277c:

    # fraud serious "叮！税务提示：大奖需先缴纳299元「个人所得税」，缴纳后手机和888元红包一并发放，否则奖品作废并列入失信名单！"
    fraud serious "Ding! Tax notice: the grand prize requires a 299-yuan \"personal income tax\" payment first — pay it and the phone plus 888-yuan red packet release together, or the prize is voided and you go on a dishonesty blacklist!"

# game/ch13.rpy:144
translate english ch13_C1_205144a7:

    # n "看着「缴税」的要求，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "Seeing the \"pay the tax\" demand, Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch13.rpy:145
translate english ch13_C1_c9e9f9b8:

    # think serious "不对！老师说，中奖缴税是在发奖时扣除，从来不会让中奖人先垫付！先是公证费，又是个人所得税，这就是连环骗局！"
    think serious "Wait! Teacher said prize tax is deducted at payout — winners never advance it! First a notary fee, now income tax: it's a chain scam!"

# game/ch13.rpy:146
translate english ch13_C1_b39b23a8:

    # mc serious "我不缴了！中奖交公证费、垫税款，全是你们编的名目，我要举报你！"
    mc serious "I'm done paying! Notary fees, advance taxes — all your invented charges. I'm reporting you!"

# game/ch13.rpy:147
translate english ch13_C1_953cfdef:

    # n "阿狐退出对话、举报账号，把完整经过告诉妈妈。妈妈肯定了他的判断，还陪他向反诈平台提交了线索。"
    n "Ahu left the chat, reported the account, and told Mom the whole story. She affirmed his judgment and helped him submit the tip to the anti-fraud platform."

# game/ch13.rpy:150
translate english ch13_C1_61679bb8:

    # police serious "「中奖纳税」的常识掌握得非常扎实！记住：所有让你先垫付税费、公证费的中奖，全是诈骗。骗子的每一步收费，都是为了掏空你的钱包！"
    police serious "Your knowledge of prize taxation is rock solid! Remember: any prize that makes you advance taxes or notary fees is fraud. Every charge a scammer invents exists to empty your wallet!"

# game/ch13.rpy:162
translate english ch13_C2_c0d7fac6:

    # n "阿狐舍不得已付的88元，决定再付150元「部分税款」表个诚意。"
    n "Reluctant to lose the 88 yuan already paid, Ahu decided to send 150 yuan as \"partial tax\" to show good faith."

# game/ch13.rpy:163
translate english ch13_C2_8089c88f:

    # think laugh "先付一部分，把大奖稳住，剩下的慢慢说。"
    think laugh "Pay part now to lock in the prize, settle the rest slowly."

# game/ch13.rpy:164
translate english ch13_C2_e526f66c:

    # n "150元转过去，对方立刻发来新通知：税款必须一次性缴清，已缴部分自动转为「手续费」，不予退还。"
    n "The 150 yuan went through, and a new notice came instantly: tax must be paid in one lump sum — partial payments automatically convert to \"handling fees\" and are non-refundable."

# game/ch13.rpy:165
translate english ch13_C2_9cbba346:

    # mc confused "说好的部分税款，怎么又变成手续费了？"
    mc confused "Wasn't that \"partial tax\"? Now it's a \"handling fee\"?"

# game/ch13.rpy:166
translate english ch13_C2_e043bdd5:

    # n "阿狐把事情告诉妈妈。妈妈判断是连环收费骗局，238元已无法追回。"
    n "Ahu told Mom. She judged it a chain-fee scam — the 238 yuan was unrecoverable."

# game/ch13.rpy:169
translate english ch13_C2_6ce8faf7:

    # police serious "骗子的收费名目会一直「变身」：公证费、税款、手续费……只要你在乎「已付的钱」，就会一直被牵着走。及时止损，才是保住钱包的唯一办法！"
    police serious "A scammer's fees keep \"shapeshifting\": notary fee, tax, handling fee... As long as you cling to what you've already paid, they'll lead you by the nose. Cutting losses in time is the only way to save your wallet!"

# game/ch13.rpy:181
translate english ch13_C3_b91b4d89:

    # n "阿狐怕「列入失信名单」，又付了299元税款。"
    n "Afraid of the \"dishonesty blacklist\", Ahu paid the 299-yuan tax too."

# game/ch13.rpy:182
translate english ch13_C3_2ef7c84c:

    # n "紧接着对方又以「红包提现手续费」「未成年人监护认证金」为由继续要钱，阿狐前前后后转了880元。"
    n "Then came more demands — \"red packet withdrawal fee\", \"minor guardianship verification fee\" — and Ahu transferred 880 yuan in all."

# game/ch13.rpy:183
translate english ch13_C3_93a82c93:

    # n "说好的手机没影，888元红包也提不出来。再发消息——红色感叹号，被拉黑了。"
    n "No sign of the phone, and the 888-yuan red packet couldn't be withdrawn. Another message — a red exclamation mark. Blocked."

# game/ch13.rpy:184
translate english ch13_C3_4b3a6708:

    # mc sad "手机没等到，还倒贴了880块……妈妈知道会伤心的……"
    mc sad "No phone, and I'm out 880 yuan on top... Mom will be heartbroken..."

# game/ch13.rpy:185
translate english ch13_C3_55c51d8c:

    # n "阿狐向妈妈坦白了经过，妈妈陪他报警备案。"
    n "Ahu confessed the whole story to Mom, and she went with him to file a police report."

# game/ch13.rpy:186
translate english ch13_C3_0eb61e50:

    # mom normal "记住：所有突然掉下来的「大奖」，都是鱼钩上的饵。"
    mom normal "Remember: every \"grand prize\" that suddenly falls into your lap is bait on a hook."

# game/ch13.rpy:189
translate english ch13_C3_0fa15d5c:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！「虚假中奖」三部曲：假弹窗、假名单、连环收费。没参加过的抽奖不会中奖，中奖先交钱必是诈骗，弹窗链接一律不理！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! The \"fake prize\" trilogy: a fake pop-up, a fake list, chain fees. A draw you never entered can't be won; a prize that charges first is always fraud; pop-up links always get ignored!"

translate english strings:

    # game/ch13.rpy:23
    old "想起反诈口诀，关闭页面并举报"
    new "Remember the anti-fraud rhyme — close the page and report"

    # game/ch13.rpy:25
    old "问一问：领奖为什么还要交公证费？"
    new "Ask: why does claiming a prize need a notary fee?"

    # game/ch13.rpy:27
    old "大奖就在眼前，马上登记领奖"
    new "The prize is right there — register and claim now"

    # game/ch13.rpy:59
    old "拿不准，拿着平板去找妈妈"
    new "Not sure — take the tablet to Mom"

    # game/ch13.rpy:61
    old "身份证号不填，公证费也不交，直接回绝"
    new "No ID number, no notary fee — refuse them outright"

    # game/ch13.rpy:63
    old "相信名单，填身份信息登记领奖"
    new "Trust the list — register with my ID info"

    # game/ch13.rpy:133
    old "猛然醒悟：哪有让中奖人先垫税的？"
    new "Wake up: since when do winners advance the tax?"

    # game/ch13.rpy:135
    old "心存侥幸，再付150元「部分税款」"
    new "Take a chance — pay 150 yuan as \"partial tax\""

    # game/ch13.rpy:137
    old "怕列入失信名单，赶紧缴税"
    new "Afraid of the blacklist — pay the tax quickly"

